{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜節目《女神配對計劃2》中的「女神」之一俞可程，被傳與已離婚的無綫導演拍拖，有扮單身呃劇組及觀眾之嫌，而在日前播出的《女》節目內，其所有鏡頭被Cut走，不過有指她火速復工，重回資訊性節目的工作崗位，似乎未被無綫封殺。</p><p>日前有指她一早返將</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.497368+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T05:02:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:41.775403+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:41.775403+00:00","content_hash":"61d6fe73d9ada74d85902d49b28010794ee3c7653660b02c521e7e9b77a5b830","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}